  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amazon Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Amazon Fund is a REDD+ mechanism created to raise donations for non-reimbursable investments in efforts to prevent, monitor and combat deforestation, as well as to promote the preservation and sustainable use in the Brazilian Amazon. The UK committed to funding &#xa3;115 million total for results-based finance at $5 per tonne and &#xa3;3.5 million for technical assistance, of which &#xa3;2 million will be destined for GIZ Action for Forests programme. &#xa3;1.5 million is for MEL.</narrative>
  </description>
